# SQLite database files — must NOT be tracked in git.
# Committing the DB causes checkpoint/workspace-restore operations to silently
# revert the file to its committed state, erasing any users or run data that
# were written after the last commit.  The DB is self-initialising via
# create_auth_tables() in api/db.py; it re-creates itself on first startup.
gridsignal.db
gridsignal.db-wal
gridsignal.db-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
